        "citation": "Shank v. Commissioner, T.C. Memo. 2018-33 (Mar. 20, 2018), No. 1752-17",
        "uri": "https://dawson.ustaxcourt.gov/case-detail/1752-17",
        "sha256": "94612d7eb8696cb883d356b49caf2129b517b088f68b4dd4d705e75724afec0e"
      },
      "rationale": "Court found testimony credible and used the brokerage records to establish 4760 dollars of initial nondeductible contributions with no later contributions. This is a reconstruction of this actual adjudicated record, not a universal evidence-sufficiency test. Independent legal and formalization review pending; no current citator claim."
    },
